{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-04-19 10:00:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES NAMED TO NEWSWEEK AND LATINO LEADERS MAGAZINE AWARDS LISTS DURING CELEBRATE DIVERSITY MONTH', 'text': "CARRIER NAMED TO AMERICA'S GREATEST WORKPLACES FOR DIVERSITY 2023 LIST BY NEWSWEEK AND LATINO LEADERS MAGAZINE BEST COMPANIES TO WORK FOR LATINOS 2023 DALLAS , APRIL 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO.\xa0 (NYSE: LUV)\xa0CELEBRATES EARNING A SPOT ON NEWSWEEK'S AMERICA'S GREATEST WORKPLACES FOR DIVERSITY 2023\xa0AND LATINO LEADERS MAGAZINE BEST COMPANIES TO WORK FOR LATINOS 2023. THE DALLAS-BASED CARRIER RECEIVED THESE RECOGNITIONS FOR PROVIDING A SUPPORTIVE WORKPLACE WHILE FOSTERING AND CELEBRATING DIVERSITY."}